Bounded opt-in audio producer attribution for AUDIO-01. Last-publication IOP grant/context and per-reason published-frame totals distinguish upstream cycle progress from register/stream-driven small batches. Producer state is copied under the existing output mutex; default audio timing, buffering and resampling are unchanged. Diagnostic measurement only; no performance or dropout gain claimed.
Validation: full verify and a 120-second visible smoke passed all 12 gates.
See AUDIO-01 for stream-position attribution and timing limitations.

